# LaTeX build artifacts.
# compile-textbooks.yml deletes *.aux, *.bbl and *.blg in its pre_compile step
# before every build, so committed copies are never read -- they only dirty the
# working tree after a local compile and go stale against the sources.
*.aux
*.toc
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
/tmp/

# Quarto build output (issue #4597: moved out of docs/, which holds tracked
# internal documentation ADRs, dev logs, CSS plans). The deploy-website
# workflow renders QMDs into _site/ and deploys that to GitHub Pages.
/_site/

# Quarto-bundled vendor libraries (generated output, issue #3182).
# Quarto emits these into the render output dir (_site/site_libs/, ignored above).
# A stale copy was previously tracked at the repo root and inflated source-quality
# metrics; the deploy workflow regenerates them via `quarto render`.
/site_libs/

# Artifact/temp file patterns (fixes #2331)
*.tmp
*.diff
*.bak
desktop.ini
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Root-level automation/review scratch files
/.ci_trigger.py
/C*tmprunid.txt
/PR_*.md
/ISSUE_*.md
/pr_body.txt
/test_notes.html
/tmp_issue_bodies/
/.tmp_issue_bodies/

# FUSE filesystem artifacts (deleted-but-open files on a FUSE mount)
.fuse_hidden*
